WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:02.930
The clouds between the
stars of the galaxy are

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:05.390
made of everything that
the earth, your body and

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:06.410
your car is made of.

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:08.960
There's everything that
you need floating in

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:10.460
gaseous form between the
stars.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.780
4.5 billion years ago.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.730
The gas and dust
collapse once more.

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:23.500
It ignites explosively
to create a new star.

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:24.490
Our Sun.

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:27.130
Close to the young son.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.370
All of the lighter stuff
got blown away.

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:31.990
What was left behind was
the heavier, denser

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:37.520
stuff. There was carbon,
there was iron, there was

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:38.600
gold, everything in
between.

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:45.640
Over time, these free
floating elements begin

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:46.690
to coalesce.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.490
Dust becomes rock.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.530
Rocks joined to form
larger objects called

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:56.790
Planetesimals. Finally,
Planetesimals joined to

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:57.840
form the Earth.

